 Strike</a>, see <a href=\"/wiki/Ensnared_(Ensnaring_Strike)_(Condition)\" title=\"Ensnared (Ensnaring Strike) (Condition)\">Ensnared (Ensnaring Strike) (Condition)</a>. For the base Ensnared condition, see <a href=\"/wiki/Ensnared_(Condition)\" title=\"Ensnared (Condition)\">Ensnared (Condition)</a>.  </div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ensnared Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Ensnared_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Ensnared</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Cannot move.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title